# Whole fights, each to a death, with violence_update on. In the temple (3001), with Hassan: Smokegod (60, with
# wiznet's levels and mob deaths on) and Rambler (2, a warrior with 29 hit points and 2088 experience of the 3000 that
# level 3 needs), who turns autoloot, autogold and autosac on. Seraph waits in the temple square (3005), to hear the
# death cries. Rambler kills four ducks (3124, level 1), each fight running until the duck is DEAD:
# - the first carries a small sword and 10 gold from Smokegod: autoloot takes both, and autosac then sacrifices the
#   empty corpse
# - with autoloot off, the second's 10 gold goes by autogold
# - Rambler wields the sword for the last two, and the fourth raises a level, which wiznet shows Smokegod
@updates area,violence
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
wiznet on
wiznet levels
wiznet mobdeaths
set char smokegod gold 100
@connect ser
Seraph
smoke123
@return
@return
south
@connect ram
Rambler
psswrd
@return
@return
autoloot
autogold
autosac
@as god
@mob 3124 3001
load obj 3021
give sword duck
give 10 gold duck
@as ram
kill duck
@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!
@state
look
autoloot
@as god
@mob 3124 3001
give 10 gold duck
@as ram
kill duck
@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!
@state
wield sword
@as god
@mob 3124 3001
@as ram
kill duck
@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!
@as god
@mob 3124 3001
@as ram
kill duck
@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!
@state
